Package: swordfish-portable
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0, libc6 (>= 2.28)
Recommends: yad | zenity
Homepage: https://github.com/hasmak-44/Swordfish-FM
Description: Swordfish FM file manager, installed as a portable folder
 Swordfish FM is a lightweight X11 file manager based on Xfe.
 .
 This package contains the official portable build. During installation it
 asks where to put it, copies the Swordfish-Portable folder there for the
 installing user, adds a menu entry and links
 /usr/local/bin/swordfish-portable to it. Settings stay inside the folder,
 so it can still be moved or copied to another computer.
 .
 Removing the package deletes the copied folder, including its settings.
